  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Insect Storage</em></p>\n<p>You have learned to concentrate the venom of your cursed centipede and add it to your attacks. When you or your centipede hit with a melee attack, you can spend 1 CE to force the creature to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, the creature takes your proficiency in d6s of poison damage and they are stunned until the beginning of their next turn.</p>",
